{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the prehistoric warzone as <strong>GORACK</strong>,\u00a0a hulking primal murder machine prowling the lands seeking <strong><i>WOMEN</i> </strong>and <strong><i>MEAT</i></strong>! But when visitors from beyond the stars crash-land, a terrifying new weapon is recovered from the wreckage. An <strong>ENERGY PISTOL</strong> of <strong>ALIEN ORIGIN!</strong>\u00a0But something <i>else</i> fell to Earth that day...with intent to get it <i>back</i>.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong>  <br>  <br>- Explore a\u00a0<strong>3D PRIMAL OPEN-WORLD</strong>\u00a0and uncover hidden secrets waiting to be discovered!\u00a0<br>- Access an array of brutal weapons like clubs, spears and rocks, as well as an <i>ALIEN ENERGY PISTOL</i>  <br>- A brutal prehistoric protagonist with a wide range of physical attacks!<br>-\u00a0Battle <strong>over 60 different types of DINOSAURS</strong> and prehistoric creatures!  <br>- A tale of prehistoric survival and dominion with a sci-fi twist!<br>- Set melee weapons on <strong><i>FIRE</i></strong> for extra damage!<br>- Craft <strong>OUTFITS </strong>from <strong>SKINS </strong>dropped\u00a0by defeated <strong>DINOSAURS!</strong>  <br>- <strong>CONSUME </strong>various <strong>FRUIT </strong>and <strong>MUSHROOMS\u00a0</strong>to activate temporary effects!  <br>- Supports\u00a0<strong>KEYBOARD/MOUSE\u00a0</strong>and <strong>XBOX GAME CONTROLLER </strong>( Mostly, some menus still need mouse/keyboard for now ) <br>-\u00a0Save/Load system!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884400?t=1759492558","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884400/f8882a2af0e37a7da7e98791c307bb859b874a54/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759492558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884400/16c0321db2fed1ddd43a0d1ac1e06461a23a8e8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759492558","capsule_imagev5":